    "Spectators and permitted detail groups use separate views without redundant headings or legacy buttons",
    "Connected defeated participants are not labelled disconnected and actual former rows remain distinct",
    "Real delegated tab clicks preserve per-view scroll, active tab focus and zero game writes across 1Hz refresh",
    "Focused table and held Space activation survive a valid refresh; invalid role data redacts immediately",
    "Context, real/viewed role, session and capability loss reset details and discard previous-view scroll",
    "Held touch refresh deferral remains bounded and never delays stale data redaction",
    "Player navigation remains read-only while an already submitted production ACK is consumed",
    "Global Players toggle and Back preserve combat intent and restore battlefield input without new owned requests",
    "Compact surface contains scroll, hides redundant local headings and uses the approved existing icon system",
    "Freshness and key listeners tear down without retaining panel handlers",
    "All app sources match the accepted baseline except the two approved UI files and one approved eye icon; Java, networking, native data and gameplay sources are preserved"
